  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Mana sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use an (expunge) talent on a creature that can use spells or sphere effects, you can spend an additional spell point to destabilize their magic, increasing their wild magic chance by 20% for a number of rounds equal to your casting ability modifier, unless they succeed a Will saving throw against your Mana sphere DC. This increase to wild magic chance increases by 10% for every wild magic feat you possess (maximum 60%).</p>\n<p>For information regarding wild magic events and the wild magic system, see <a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wild-magic\">Wild Magic</a> by Drop Dead Studios.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wild-magic-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
